    "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md": [
      {
        "id": "stezjgdkr",
        "text": "比肩克财",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 44,
        "startOffset": 806,
        "endOffset": 814,
        "filePath": "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "- 既要求伴侣服从，又对伴侣挑剔；"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1786838342765,
        "isNativeComment": false,
        "type": "highlight"
      },
      {
        "id": "bwalsfpoi",
        "text": "财源",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 46,
        "startOffset": 855,
        "endOffset": 861,
        "filePath": "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "卖假烟、跑腿、代肝游戏等"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1786838342816,
        "isNativeComment": false,
        "type": "highlight"
      },
      {
        "id": "5pyhsz0qh",
        "text": "自以为是的倾向",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 48,
        "startOffset": 922,
        "endOffset": 933,
        "filePath": "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "如买东西时虽然会问其他人意见，但也只是找个合理的由头。即使别人百般劝阻，但也会固执己见。"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1786838342885,
        "isNativeComment": false,
        "type": "highlight"
      },
      {
        "id": "ixefoic5a",
        "text": "自我色彩太重",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 49,
        "startOffset": 968,
        "endOffset": 978,
        "filePath": "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "在恋爱关系中过于以自我为中心，说话、做事、做决定时，习惯从自己的角度、感受和利益出发，较少考虑女友的想法和需求。女友觉得被忽视、不被尊重，时间久了就会积累成不满。"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1786838341932,
        "isNativeComment": false,
        "type": "highlight"
      },
      {
        "id": "48kiip02q",
        "text": "大男人主义",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 50,
        "startOffset": 999,
        "endOffset": 1008,
        "filePath": "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "认为男性应该处于主导地位，女性应该顺从、配合。会让伴侣感到压抑、不被尊重，容易积累不满。"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1786838341964,
        "isNativeComment": false,
        "type": "highlight"
      },
      {
        "id": "thxqb5fix",
        "text": "近于苛求",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 50,
        "startOffset": 1013,
        "endOffset": 1021,
        "filePath": "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "对自己和别人都要求完美。"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1786838341978,
        "isNativeComment": false,
        "type": "highlight"
      },
      {
        "id": "69bu9pz54",
        "text": "不会理财",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 50,
        "startOffset": 1026,
        "endOffset": 1034,
        "filePath": "子平洞观/比劫/01比肩/03实务周边认知.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "花钱没有计划，冲动消费。"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1786838341991,
        "isNativeComment": false,
        "type": "highlight"
      }
    ],
    "子平洞观/官杀/正官/01性格.md": [
      {
        "id": "rofbt508o",
        "text": "好好先生",
